  "details": "I wanted to ask a couple of questions for possible updates in the near future.\nWhat if the avatar was a character that relies on floating/flying? Is there an implementation for that in the future? Even if it's behind a premium paywall, it'd be a nice addition. Same for avatars whose characters rely on something like esp to detect \"auras\" of other characters/avatars.\nI also wanted to know if there will there be implementations of accessibility options for the disabled? Like \"missing fingers\" configuration, close-caption and tts?",
